(1) Notwithstanding anything contained in sections 4 and 5, an intermediary shall,
except in the cases mentioned in the proviso to sub-section (2) but subject to the other provision of that sub-section, be entitled t retain with effect from the date of vesting-- (a) land comprised in homesteads;
(b) land comprised in or appertaining to buildings and structures owned by the intermediary or by any person, not being a tenant ,holding under him by leave or license; Explanation.
